  "textSample": "Alert\nContact Property Contact\nSave Alert\n\nSimilar listings in\n\nCreate an Alert\nParking Information\nFeatures & Amenities\nUtilities Included\nAbout Revolve\n\nExpertly envisioned by Peterson, Revolve offers a rare opportunity to live in a brand new, purpose built rental on Kingsway. Rising 14 stories to redefine the skyline, Revolve acts as the axis of culture and connection – where the vibrant energy of the Kingsway corridor pairs with a contemporary vision of distinctly refined living. Managed by Peterson Commercial.\n\nEmbrace connection and live where Vancouver’s most desirable lifestyle neighbourhoods overlap. Just 15 minutes from downtown Vancouver, Revolve closely connects you to Mount Pleasant, the Fraser Triangle, Trout Lake and Norquay Village. Further out you’ll find the bustling hubs of Commercial Drive to the East and Main Street to the West.\n\n\nAdditional Information:\nKeyless entry\nOutdoor play area\nEnsuite bathroom\nCity views\nInternet ready\nComplimentary WIFI in social areas\nVinyl Plank Floors\nSecurity Cameras\nKitchen & Dining Area\nUniversal Washroom\nCo-Working Space\nOutdoor Dining Area\nKids Play Area\nCommunity Garden\nLandscaped Patio\nTrout Lake Park\nJackson's General School\nMatchstick Fraser Street\nDo Chay\nRobson Park\nEquinox Gallery\nElectric equipped parking\nMountain views\nBike storage\nModo car share\nYoga Designed Space\nMath Kids Courses\nDog Washing Station\nElectric Vehicle charging spaces\nRooftop terrace with BBQ\nBike storage room\nOn site property management\nParcel Lockers\n1Valet Building Management\n\nExpertly envisioned by Peterson, Revolve offers a rare opportunity to live in a brand new, purpose built rental on Kingsway. Rising 14 stories to redefine the skyline, Revolve acts as the axis of culture and connection – where the vibrant energy of the Kingsway corridor pairs with a contemporary vision of distinctly refined living. Managed by Peterson Commercial.\n\nEmbrace connection and l